<div class="ed-reading guide-reading text-lg">
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Moving to a new phone or tablet is easier when you first confirm what kind of move you are making. Apple-to-Apple and Android-to-Android transfers usually have an official setup path. The exact experience still depends on the device model, software version, available storage and the manufacturer’s guidance. A phone guide is not automatically a guide for every tablet. Check the exact devices before starting.</p>
<section class="ed-start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><p class="ed-label">Start here</p><h2 id="start-heading">Start with the path, not the cable</h2><p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Choose the matching ecosystem and confirm that both devices are ready for a controlled check.</p><div class="ed-choices">
